STEPS=[('Pack','What should Red bring? Pick 3 things.','Grandma is sick. Mom says, "Let us fill a basket with nice things for her."','Toy Bear, Flowers and Cookies','Bear, flowers and cookies hop into the basket one by one. Red bounces.'),
 ('Mom','What does Mom tell Red before she goes?','Mom gives Red a big hug. "Go straight to Grandma\'s house," she says.','Stay on the path','Mom waves, a path bubble pops up, hearts float up.'),
 ('Path','Which way should Red go?','In the forest, the path splits in two.','The path to Grandma\'s house','Red walks the path to the signpost. A sparkle marks Grandma\'s house.'),
 ('Wolf','A wolf says hello. What should Red do?','A wolf steps out from behind a tree and asks where Red is going.','Keep walking and tell a grown-up','The wolf peeks from behind the tree and wags his tail. A question bubble pops.'),
 ('Flowers','Red sees pretty flowers. What now?','Bright flowers sway in the meadow. Grandma is still waiting.','Pick one, then keep going','Flowers sway, a butterfly flutters, Red waves.'),
 ('Bed','Grandma looks different. Pick 3 things that look odd.','Red steps into the cottage. Someone is in Grandma\'s bed.','Big ears, big eyes and big teeth','The wolf in Grandma\'s cap blinks. Gold rings pulse on ears, eyes and teeth.'),
 ('Help','Red is scared. What should she do?','Red shouts as loud as she can.','Shout for the woodcutter','Red shouts, birds fly off, the woodcutter runs in.'),
 ('Grandma','Where was Grandma?','The woodcutter opens the wardrobe. Grandma is safe!','Safe in the wardrobe','Grandma peeks out, hearts rise, Red waves.'),
 ('Remember','What did Red learn? Pick 3 rules.','Red hugs Grandma. Now she knows what to do next time.','Stay on the path, no strangers, tell a grown-up','Three rule cards flip in one by one. Sparkles twinkle.')]
